          hold: hold the button down, drag onto an entry - it
          highlights as the pointer crosses it - and release to
          choose it.  Releasing outside the menu, or without
          moving onto an entry, chooses nothing.  The keyboard is
          ignored while a menu is up.  Pressing on the empty
          desktop opens the desktop menu; pressing on a window
          opens that window's menu.

     ddeesskkttoopp mmeennuu
