          raises its existing window instead of starting a second
          copy), then SSwwiittcchh ttoo..., a dialog of all open windows,
          and QQuuiitt, which confirms and then shuts the GUI down,
          restoring the text console.

     wwiinnddooww mmeennuu
          starts with the entries the application asked for (from
          NNeeww, OOppeenn, SSaavvee, CCuutt, CCooppyy, PPaassttee, SSeettttiinnggss, HHeellpp),
          then MMoovvee, SSttrreettcchh (resizable windows only), FFrroonntt,
          BBaacckk, HHiiddee and QQuuiitt. Some applications confirm Quit
